# 设计文档（docs/ 下全部 Markdown）入库；其余目录的 Markdown 默认忽略（本地笔记）
**/*.md
!README.md
!README_zh-CN.md
!docs/**/*.md
# OpenSumi 本地参考（不提交 GitHub）
frontend-opensumi/
opensumi-reference/
frontend-legacy/
scripts/build-electron.*
configs/opensumi*
docs/opensumi*

# Wails 构建临时文件
*.syso
wails_windows_*.syso
build/windows/nsis/MicrosoftEdgeWebview2Setup.exe
build/windows/nsis/*-installer.exe

# 本地数据与构建产物
/data/
/bin/
/dist/
*.exe
agentgo.exe
agentgo_build.exe
go.work
go.mod.local
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Go
/vendor/

# JavaScript dependencies
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/

# Local working copies, exports, and reference bundles
.agents/
.config/
.local/
.task/
coze-studio-main/
artifacts/
attached_assets/
*.zip

# IDE / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# 敏感配置（本地 LLM 密钥，勿提交）
config.json
**/config.json
config.local.json
.env
.env.*

# 忽略根目录下的 ps1 脚本，防止密钥泄漏
/*.ps1


# eval scratch files written by agentgo-eval cases
.eval-scratch/

# 构建产物不入库：前端由 build/Taskfile.yml 的 build:frontend 或 scripts/build-frontend.ps1 生成，
# frontend/dist/.gitkeep 仅用于满足 go:embed。
/frontend/dist/*
!/frontend/dist/.gitkeep

# Eino 上游参考副本不参与构建（构建用模块缓存里的版本）；本地联调见 docs/build-reproducible.md 的 go.work
/eino-ext/

# Vendored source that is compiled into the binary (embedded prompt templates are .md); see third_party/crush/NOTICE.md
!/third_party/**
!/third_party/**/*.md
!/third_party/**/.env.sample
